OL,3,APornhub investigated over its age
OL,4,Achecks
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfcom has launched an investigation
OL,7,Finto Pornhub owner, Aylo, over whether
OL,8,Fthe site's new age checks are
OL,9,Feffectively stopping children from
OL,10,Faccessing adult content.
OL,12,FThe regulator said in May that Pornhub
OL,13,Fstarted using a new age verification
OL,14,Fprocess for some users, which relies on
OL,15,Fa third party, in this case Apple.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,10702
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F107A1790166257
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,APornhub investigated over its age
OL,4,Achecks
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said it had concerns that Aylo "may
OL,7,Fnot have conducted sufficient due
OL,8,Fdiligence and testing" before
OL,9,Fimplementing this new process, and so
OL,10,Fit "may not be highly effective" at
OL,11,Fpreventing children from seeing
OL,12,Fpornography.
OL,14,FUnder the UK's Online Safety Act (OSA),
OL,15,Fsites that host pornographic material
OL,16,Fmust use highly effective age assurance
OL,17,Fto ensure whether a user is over 18.
